{"time": 1775486687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "647880848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "叹口气，“至少我们还安好吧，不过接下来要咋办呀”"}
{"time": 1775486777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "922097373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“报警是不可能了，先把可能有用的线索都带走吧。他们的死应该跟晓梅，金茂还有整个野荷塘的秘密都有关系”"}
