{"time": 1775649829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "356374843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=103225322]（那我会陪你演的（）"}
{"time": 1775649856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807457929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“之前我就觉得你问的东西莫名其妙，你为什么会觉得我和金茂有关系？”"}
{"time": 1775649934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "166458056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "他掏出一根红梅香烟点燃"}
{"time": 1775649952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "697028914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“凭什么？当然是凭这半个镇子都吃着金茂的饭啊”"}
{"time": 1775649993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "417766571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“警官，我看您不像是刚来这里的新人，难道，你对金茂真的一无所知吗？”"}
{"time": 1775650164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1845115035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“赫赫，我只知道周茂他给咱们野荷塘做了很多好事，怎么，你还想把这些事脏给他？”"}
{"time": 1775650206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "157195378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“说说你的论点”"}
{"time": 1775650251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1438501151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”……警官，记得前两天的雨夜吗？“"}
{"time": 1775650347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "556193119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”很抱歉，出事的不止有追捕我们的警力，还有另一辆车。如果警方有顺着公路调查，那一定会在路边找到一具尸体“"}
{"time": 1775650370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "976697414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（然而山路被封了）"}
{"time": 1775650386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "971029504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（而且泥石流下有没有尸体也不知道了嘻嘻）"}
{"time": 1775650397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "172077483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“然后呢”记笔记"}
{"time": 1775650399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1090121109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1775650438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "408255481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（可以说夏雨旅馆的事吧）"}
{"time": 1775650448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "813784695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（那个夫人大概率是被这怪物杀的）"}
{"time": 1775650463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1490504309", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”如果你们能搜得仔细一点，应该可以找到一辆金茂公司的车“"}
{"time": 1775650488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "30950378", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我决定你们几个人在这边管闲事，对警察而言就有一种顾左右而言他的感觉）"}
{"time": 1775650495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1326826406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我觉得你们几个人在这边管闲事，对警察而言就有一种顾左右而言他的感觉）"}
{"time": 1775650509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341910887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（对）"}
{"time": 1775650519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2096742590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“所以孩子呢？”"}
{"time": 1775650524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2056904571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”女童，曾被关在那车上，我们顺手就从出事的地方带了进来“"}
{"time": 1775650569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1564202070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1326826406]（没招啊，神神鬼鬼的东西怎么解释都不好说）"}
{"time": 1775650641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "150611471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（而且我就觉得很奇怪，如果他知道我们是逃犯，为什么不早在医院就出手，放长线然后抓4个吗？）"}
{"time": 1775650644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "878779015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这也可以是你们为了骗我而编造的谎言，不排除你们是看到了有这么一辆车以后才这么说的可能”"}
{"time": 1775650670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1784688517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（因为你们手里有小孩，他想先看看怎么个事"}
{"time": 1775650684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "383344012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（其次就是如果他一直在跟踪，为什么没有跟着王和徐两人看见夏雨旅店的凶杀案）"}
{"time": 1775650707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53154127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（因为他是跟着孩子走"}
{"time": 1775650717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181694845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（反正你们都会回来"}
{"time": 1775650719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "857951096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=878779015]#我要绘声绘色的说，凭肢体动作感染他"}
{"time": 1775650728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "965214152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": ".rh"}
