{"time": 1775650728, "type": "reply_private", "message_id": "965214152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "在演奏厅中[夜鹿夜游真夜中]演奏出: 1D100=38"}
{"time": 1775650774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1449609518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”在这之前，警官，我先问一下，你们这里也是有戴罪立功的规矩吧“"}
{"time": 1775650782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1122390709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”我要举报一起凶杀案“"}
{"time": 1775650874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1015152415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不要转移话题，等会再说其他事，你们声称从金茂的车里面取走了这个小孩，然后呢？”"}
{"time": 1775650931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1302698471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”然后还能怎么办，到镇上来了呗。“"}
{"time": 1775651002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2097900052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”荒郊野岭的，也就镇上能住人“"}
{"time": 1775651060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133305784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“金茂的车上没有人吗？”"}
{"time": 1775651082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1978751016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“按你们说的，好像这小孩是被他们拐卖的一样”"}
{"time": 1775651100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1569508498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”只有一个司机，已经死了。”"}
{"time": 1775651164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "193982002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1978751016]“我该说的都说了， 怎么判断是您的事情。”"}
{"time": 1775651182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2005702542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（其实吧"}
{"time": 1775651189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "191993020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（其实吧）"}
{"time": 1775651201, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558445463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你们让他看看孩子背后的东西不就行了("}
{"time": 1775651222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533239515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“感觉说服力很低啊”"}
{"time": 1775651228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1565492761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（看精忠报国？）"}
{"time": 1775651258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "443099053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（那我怎么知道他知道婴儿背后的字然后就可以增加说服力）"}
