{"time": 1775651356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1236132423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（唉，那提示了就做呗）"}
{"time": 1775651371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "995944819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“为什么金茂要干这种事？你空口无凭说他们拐卖儿童，有啥其他线索或者证据吗”"}
{"time": 1775651376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "774922877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“警官，你应该看看女童背上有什么”"}
{"time": 1775651424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "663028374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（而且比起四个罪不是很重的通缉犯，凶杀案不应该更重要吗）"}
