{"time": 1775651563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2076313190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=556876031]（没理由拖延时间啊，难道我还有救兵吗（）"}
{"time": 1775651605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "830924123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（而且我也不清楚警察看到一个符文就会放着四个通缉犯不管）"}
