{"time": 1775653067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "796632256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”不管我再怎么说，你也会觉得我又是在栽赃金茂吧“"}
{"time": 1775653231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "638328899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "他看了看手中的笔记本，又吸了口烟“不，我觉得你说的应该是实话，我也认为金茂有些问题，刚才只不过在诈你们罢了”他咧嘴一笑"}
{"time": 1775653265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "456923496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“但是吧，办案需要证据，我没有证据也不能去找金茂的麻烦”"}
{"time": 1775653332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1519634341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“从你们刚到就带孩子去医院的行动来看，本性应该也还不算坏，刚才你说过想要将功补过的机会是吧？”"}
{"time": 1775653342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "790990684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=417766571]（猜的到是不错，不过没诈出来就是了）"}
{"time": 1775653377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "670550469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1519634341]“是啊，不过这个您能说了算吗？”"}
{"time": 1775653508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1106194564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这个镇子上存在着一股巨大的邪恶，我以前就觉得金茂可能有什么不可告人的秘密，苦于没有证据，你们协助我找到相关的线索，我会上报局里给你们酌情减刑的”"}
{"time": 1775653582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123259195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“那就谢谢警官理解了”"}
{"time": 1775653589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "699651169", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“不过，顺带一提”"}
{"time": 1775653621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522382457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“不过，顺带一问”"}
{"time": 1775653627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "93436975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“镇上想要调查金茂的警察，应该不止您一个吧？”"}
{"time": 1775653645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "476099326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（别又整个布鲁诺过来）"}
{"time": 1775653707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744046013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不，我之前调查三太子惨案的时候开始怀疑金茂的，其他人并不知晓”"}
{"time": 1775653723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1004705544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你们听说过三太子惨案吗”"}
{"time": 1775653743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1610864486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“听过”"}
{"time": 1775653767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1176683335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“实不相瞒，刚刚说的旅馆老板，男老板的死法与三太子惨案几乎相同”"}
{"time": 1775653796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "566512150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“应该是用了同样的手法”"}
{"time": 1775653831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1019731628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯，那就不奇怪了，那就不奇怪了”"}
{"time": 1775653955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991926114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“总之这几天你们好好地帮我找线索，我不会找你们麻烦，不过你们也不要想逃走，这镇子现在因为泥石流封了，你们逃也逃不出去”"}
{"time": 1775654006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1139279834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”好的，一定改过自新“"}
{"time": 1775654010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1308995479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“有找到什么重要信息联系我，我们交换过电话了”"}
{"time": 1775654069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1647217340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“记得去医院把你们的同伴捞回来”"}
{"time": 1775654080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "312035215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“关于三太子，我这边可能有相关的线索”"}
{"time": 1775654115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "359420486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“有位道号云清的道长曾经为人用三太子求过子，可能有什么关联”"}
{"time": 1775654117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "748659087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（唉，其实我说不说，说什么都没必要，只要说金茂，何仙姑5个字就够了。）"}
{"time": 1775654189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "930469781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我会去调查一下的”"}
{"time": 1775654233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1107747967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“祝你平安，祝我们平安”合掌祈福"}
{"time": 1775654270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1175452229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "他把你们的手铐解开，走到门口“顺便告诉你们一件事吧，我妹在我8岁的时候被拐走了，所以我此生最讨厌的就是人贩子”"}
{"time": 1775654281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1975106273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "然后他离开了"}
{"time": 1775654346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1141009156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "#看一眼徐舟，又看一眼王逍遥"}
{"time": 1775654353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1159223394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”咋办“"}
