{"time": 1775655088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "199361231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“王兄，怎么说？就睡我们房间吧”"}
{"time": 1775655137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1293638091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嗯，一起睡吧”"}
{"time": 1775655202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "348738813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "那么你们各自在不同的地方睡着"}
{"time": 1775655264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1986315878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "梦中，徐舟和倪雨睁开双眼，发现自己正身处一片迷雾之中，一个厚重如钟的声音从四面八方传来，“徐舟、倪雨，汝等可识得吾乃何人？”"}
{"time": 1775655305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "261534979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（嗨哟 没有我的事）"}
