{"time": 1776079395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2133736694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嗯，没什么不舒服的了已经”舒展下筋骨"}
{"time": 1776079428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1730835916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“能下地走动，但是毕竟有绷带缠着，总是有些行动不便，惹人注目”"}
{"time": 1776079433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "308266679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“看来昨晚旅店老板两公婆的事情已经传开了，不过没人知道我们看到的那个怪物”"}
{"time": 1776079459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "489628668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1730835916]“不妨碍，我认为我应该比你更惹人注目一点”"}
{"time": 1776079472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1451649788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=127290425]“他们既然说了不要通知警察，是不是意味着他们有我们是否通知警察的信息渠道？”"}
{"time": 1776079495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "557788176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“我们有理由怀疑警局里有金茂的眼线...”"}
{"time": 1776079553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "439037181", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1451649788]”总不能江警察也是他们的眼线“"}
{"time": 1776079573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689573418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”而且我也没在电话里说正事“"}
{"time": 1776079579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "431495703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“话说，今晚要再换家旅馆吗？”"}
