{"time": 1776079799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336077570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "过了一会，江杨警官匆匆赶到"}
{"time": 1776079806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1520586115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（我好像忘记了告诉你们他的名字）"}
{"time": 1776079851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "857975144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“怎么了，第二天一早就叫我？”"}
{"time": 1776079879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "46557917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”你看看这个“"}
{"time": 1776079885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "780886399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1520586115]（确实）"}
{"time": 1776079894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1524075409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "#拿短信给他看"}
{"time": 1776079941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1836497317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这就是绑走孩子的人？”"}
{"time": 1776079965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "155335591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”对“"}
{"time": 1776079973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1972190285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "他又习惯性地掏烟，又突然想起这里是医院，只能塞回去"}
{"time": 1776080022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "468796810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“那你们是什么打算，今晚去赴约吗”"}
{"time": 1776080044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "194728450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“不行，不可能把孩子还给他们”"}
{"time": 1776080058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1039868540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“他这短信说的不要通知警察，我说实话也拿不准警局里面有没有他们的人”"}
{"time": 1776080079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1112868858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”不是要我们调查金茂吗？这不就是最大的证据“"}
{"time": 1776080116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "182958137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“我认为可以去看看......反正到最后我们估计也会和他们对上，不如试试控制对方，说不定有机会问出些线索？”"}
{"time": 1776080120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1693764807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”我的建议是去，去了才有机会留下比较直接的证据“"}
{"time": 1776080135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "277154076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”而且……反正江兄有枪，应该不成问题吧“"}
{"time": 1776080186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "701874221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "江杨警官沉思“我一同前往谈判的话，也许会被认出来”"}
{"time": 1776080195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "434958121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“的确，我们去可以，但晓梅不能带过去”"}
{"time": 1776080228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1584645783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=701874221]“那？江警官或许可以在安全的地方帮忙带孩子，等着支援我们？”"}
{"time": 1776080252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2100859378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这个倒是没问题”"}
{"time": 1776080290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2025794564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“不过万一对面有所防备，设下埋伏，以身涉险的我们要怎么办”"}
{"time": 1776080332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "295801873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“还能怎么办？干得过就干，干不过就跑呗”"}
{"time": 1776080429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1955564906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“我觉得还是得去的，我在明敌在暗”"}
{"time": 1776080453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "974842554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“我们之前就一直在逃跑，怎么从良了大概率还是要逃跑。。。”"}
{"time": 1776080532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "169457137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这可能是重要的线索，我觉得还是有必要去一趟的”"}
{"time": 1776080560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "255880642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我在附近等着支援你们，应该也出不了什么大问题”"}
{"time": 1776080576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1430587119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“🆗”"}
{"time": 1776080592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1992756000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“嗯”"}
{"time": 1776080605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1744418505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“行吧。不过要是对方持有枪械，应该足以说服警方出警吧？”"}
{"time": 1776080651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "294130489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯，现在已经禁止私自持枪了”"}
{"time": 1776080673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "851375318", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“他们手上有枪的概率不大”"}
{"time": 1776080687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "316262355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（那么我们现在是去关帝庙还是哪里？）"}
{"time": 1776080699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1512096242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（我是要去关帝庙的）"}
{"time": 1776080715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256867560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（都被托梦了，还得去找算命师傅）"}
{"time": 1776080724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1962403690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（我也是）"}
{"time": 1776080744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "594804420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（呃，可以rp出来）"}
{"time": 1776080749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "361331757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#那么前往关帝庙，路过2时看看是什么地方"}
{"time": 1776080758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1083446089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“那我去金茂看看，前两天不是招人来着”"}
{"time": 1776080770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "60256638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "“我昨天做了奇怪的梦，想再去关帝庙看看”"}
{"time": 1776080772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "724984238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“说不定能混进去看到点什么”"}
{"time": 1776080775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "39165393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1083446089]“我陪你一起去吧”"}
{"time": 1776080778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "888207830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“一个人太危险了”"}
{"time": 1776080783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1103271323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“行”"}
{"time": 1776080802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "755065796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“我打算去关帝庙找找那位算命先生，他昨天让我驱邪仪式不顺利就回去找他的”"}
{"time": 1776080818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "114979805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=361331757]2是一个叫兴旺的宾馆"}
{"time": 1776080824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745750784", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“我们什么时候在哪汇合？还有今晚要换旅馆吗？”"}
{"time": 1776080863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "231499642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（你们先聊完再结算走吧）"}
{"time": 1776080877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1970597598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=745750784]“两边都有手机，可以看情况”"}
{"time": 1776080883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1862053830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“换肯定得换的”"}
{"time": 1776080929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "358484615", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“那好，我就先出发了”"}
{"time": 1776080939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785313095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "#抱着孩子前往关帝庙找算命先生"}
{"time": 1776080973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1468701225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "那就两人去关帝庙，两人去金茂食品厂"}
{"time": 1776080993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "737735653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=114979805]（路过2看到了"}
{"time": 1776081030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "83141626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "关帝庙门口，胖先生还是在那悠闲地摆摊"}
{"time": 1776081120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1435898310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "金茂食品厂门口，王杨二人再次看见了那贴着招聘广告的门卫亭"}
{"time": 1776081123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "626555504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=83141626]#上前去打声招呼:“先生，昨天说的驱邪，那精怪有些凶狠，应该是失败了”"}
{"time": 1776081165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2097027751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“直接附身到了我们的同伴身上，最后好不容易才压制下来，孩子的状况也没好转”"}
{"time": 1776081255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1890265891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "胖先生眯了眯眼，仔细听你说完后，长叹一口气“果然和我预想的一样......”"}
{"time": 1776081332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2134277956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#语气有些不满：”先生你既然有所预想，也许应该先告诉我们可能的后果——譬如我们的同伴被附身这种情况。“"}
{"time": 1776081356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "623109352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "”而且在仪式后，我们还遭遇了怪物的袭击“"}
{"time": 1776081372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493264061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我也心存一丝侥幸，只希望不是我心里想的那样”"}
{"time": 1776081443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1164695945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“那你所能想到的最坏情况是什么？到底是哪来的怨气如此重的水鬼？”"}
{"time": 1776081464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "181758117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“若是寻常的精怪，必会被我那黄符所镇住，如今镇不住它，只说明其背后定是那名为‘三太子’的邪物在从中作祟”"}
{"time": 1776081525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1847806486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“又是这三太子？另外三太子与荷仙姑之间有何关系？”"}
{"time": 1776081629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1140677202", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“如果晓梅是用来祭祀荷仙姑的人祭？三太子又为何出手？”"}
{"time": 1776081640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1769491641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“如果晓梅是用来祭祀荷仙姑的人祭？三太子又为何作祟？”"}
{"time": 1776081724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1328950811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“咱们野荷塘，在以前是个重男轻女的镇子，生下了女婴不满意，便会被丢到塘里淹死，久而久之便滋生了水鬼，这三太子乃是无数水鬼化为的鬼仙，两年前我师父，火禄道人想去降伏此妖，万万没想到如此强大的他竟然会死在那里......”"}
{"time": 1776081743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1395346890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（00就不重男轻女了吗）"}
{"time": 1776081757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "156214917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1769491641]“怕是这荷仙姑也是跟三太子勾结的邪祟”"}
{"time": 1776081782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1836544058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（那就自古以来"}
{"time": 1776081820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1897944909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“是因为荷花与莲藕之间的联系吗？荷仙姑与三太子勾结在一起”"}
{"time": 1776081906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1016777340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“正是此因”"}
{"time": 1776081936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "959774842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“虽然我没见过这个荷仙姑，但是三太子可万万不是你们可以对付的”"}
{"time": 1776081972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "57866218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "面露难色:“如此厉鬼？那我们要如何避开这三太子？”"}
{"time": 1776081976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1871777133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你们......还是趁早放弃吧”胖先生欲言又止，最后吐出一句话"}
{"time": 1776082021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1060799353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你们可以看出胖先生对师父离去的悲伤和对那三太子的恐惧"}
{"time": 1776082040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "532819200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“放弃？放弃什么？你是要我又一次放弃依赖着我的人吗？你也要将你师父的死放弃吗？”"}
{"time": 1776082086, "type": "recv", "message_id": "262660512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "”徐兄，冷静些...“"}
{"time": 1776082102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1665960365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "有些愤怒地扯住他的衣领:“我本以为正道之人也不会，不会放弃自己的信徒，结果。。。”"}
{"time": 1776082123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "646856335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“避开，如何避得开，那女娃已经时日不多，就算你带着她逃出这里，诅咒不解，她也活不了多久。连我师父都没能对付的了他，你们几个凡夫俗子，又能做的了什么”胖先生越说越激动"}
{"time": 1776082167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1045143645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我师父那么强大，连他都做不到，那我能怎么办？！”"}
{"time": 1776082201, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1932807427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#尝试把二人分开”目前争吵没有什么意义，我们应该思考如何去解决问题“"}
{"time": 1776082214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "849377519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#转过话题：”先生你可知这两日出现的凶杀案，似乎也和三太子有关？“"}
{"time": 1776082235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1152812796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“那如果那三太子马上就要来这野荷塘大开杀戒，你就披着你这破道袍？从这野荷塘狼狈逃离吗？就像，我去年那样。。。”被拉开后陷入沉默，只是看着怀里虚弱的晓梅"}
{"time": 1776082239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1610667321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“什么凶杀案？”胖先生整了整衣领"}
{"time": 1776082265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "50377596", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "（话说你们应该和我说过吧雾）"}
{"time": 1776082271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1494956942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（默认默认）"}
{"time": 1776082276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "794215710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（默认说过了）"}
{"time": 1776082283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1384298753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "#把旅馆夫妻的惨状告诉先生"}
{"time": 1776082345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1366213430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "”现在的情况是，邪祟已经对普通人动手了，它正在酝酿更大的阴谋，我们所有人都在危机之中。“"}
