{"time": 1776259462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1771360100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=187816599]“埋伏。。。埋伏，先生你和你师父是本地人吗？当时是怎么来野荷塘降妖除魔的？”"}
{"time": 1776259522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "964640067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我们不是本地人，当年师父带我云游四方，十几年前在这里定了居”"}
{"time": 1776259639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "921853281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“十几年前就在这定居了？三太子是刚出现，你们就出手了？还是三太子一直都藏在本地，你们看准时机出手的？”"}
{"time": 1776259719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1024716248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“是三年前那个三太子惨案，我师父介入调查后才发现的那鬼仙”"}
{"time": 1776259835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1037687220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(三太子)"}
{"time": 1776259859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1271527882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（何家三少"}
{"time": 1776259952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "612729671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1024716248]“哦，你们调查了当年的案件，我也只是在茶楼里面听了一些传闻，你还记得当时的线索吗？死者的姓名住址什么的”"}
{"time": 1776260032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "80678182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“死者住在莲河街深巷的尽头处，现在那个房子也许已经废弃了吧”"}
{"time": 1776260084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1931523782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（莲河街就是14"}
{"time": 1776260090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "132825419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（以防你们忘了"}
{"time": 1776260090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1868620258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（好的好的）"}
{"time": 1776260100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "762348126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（正打算rp让他给我指明方向的（）"}
{"time": 1776260149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749934109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=80678182]“嗯嗯，我明白了，我怀疑，当年你师父的死要么是中了埋伏，要么就是有更深的阴谋”"}
{"time": 1776260271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "300823720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“先生，你觉得我现在，是走在正道之上吗？”"}
{"time": 1776260326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1462248644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“唉，你们在去对付那鬼仙之前，可以先去一趟市场，那里有个风水店，里面有卖些桃木剑啥的，应该有些用处”"}
{"time": 1776260355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539499450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=300823720]“嘛，算是吧”"}
{"time": 1776260440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1213482978", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“既然这样。。。”从道袍里拿出那本气功秘籍，塞进胖先生手里“这本秘籍，我就送你了，我现在大概是不需要了”"}
{"time": 1776260455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "531172121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“里面有关减肥的部分，还是很科学的”"}
{"time": 1776260468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1295295228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“你不如把你的锅送我，我洗洗还能做饭用”"}
{"time": 1776260493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1301098295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“这不行，这是我的娘送我的，我再留段时间吧”"}
{"time": 1776260502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1011155765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“走之前来把锅给你”"}
{"time": 1776260508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "704857575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=24A8C5E5228D1F9326232C88123CE294.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRGmxiPDFSGqCMQ-KFEuG19O992aBjiogEg_woo5vz1hP7vkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQbwOSgF1hm6SAiPjDe1PcbHoCXZyCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMGwzDBBJz_w6K-QkNC7R77g5a8H4cil-5bElwQhPOslfw9vOqv6aDvPLLzOtRtaJQA,file_size=20834]"}
{"time": 1776260515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "259776272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "笑嘻嘻地拍拍头上的锅"}
{"time": 1776260536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1630757757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1539499450]（一不小心又用日本人语气说话了"}
{"time": 1776260546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "19310700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（本质日本人（）"}
{"time": 1776260574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "88304086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（本质日本人（）"}
{"time": 1776260622, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2121292983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“还有一件事，关于你师父的衣冠冢。。。难道他的遗骨，还在那湖里吗？”"}
{"time": 1776260683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "534178706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“可能吧，我并没有找到他的遗骨”"}
{"time": 1776260698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2002065899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“去湖里捞也太不现实了”"}
{"time": 1776260721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1587532478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“那不是还有存活的希望吗？”"}
{"time": 1776260758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1893427510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（本质日本人（）"}
{"time": 1776260778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "834475701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "拉着胖先生和我一起合掌祈祷:“我也教你一个气功，合掌闭眼，感受心跳，发自内心地祈祷平安与幸福”"}
{"time": 1776260805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821274462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“祈祷你师父还活在世间”"}
{"time": 1776260817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "173703944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“哈哈，你的好意我心领了”胖先生笑了，笑得很难过"}
{"time": 1776260938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "514287959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（哦，我都忘了洪水的事了）"}
{"time": 1776260942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "335037639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（再问问洪水）"}
{"time": 1776261030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767971505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“这三太子的来历，先生您有头绪吗？会跟数年前那场大洪水相关吗？还有藕鬼，应该算是三太子的仆从？”"}
{"time": 1776261112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "584670699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“三太子应该是那无数被抛弃的女婴化作的水鬼孕养而成，藕鬼可以算是它的手下吧”"}
{"time": 1776261133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1264303395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“至于暴雨和大洪水，那不是它能有的权柄”"}
{"time": 1776261196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1958258298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“难道是荷仙姑？这小小的野荷塘难不成有两大邪祟在作恶吗？”"}
{"time": 1776261248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1490727928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“不清楚，这荷仙姑一直隐于暗处，若不是你们前来问我，我都不知道有这个事”"}
{"time": 1776261316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1068594676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“荷与藕的关系，以及三太子的称呼，鬼怪之间会有血缘关系这种说法吗？”"}
{"time": 1776261442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "536944441", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“一般没会，最多也就是大妖带动小妖”"}
{"time": 1776261451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2013883909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“一般没有，最多也就是大妖带动小妖”"}
{"time": 1776261499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "208123327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我看这荷仙姑和三太子估计也是为了碰瓷神话传说里的何仙姑和哪吒罢”"}
{"time": 1776261564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1315030518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“明白了，我暂时也没什么想问的了，我打算先去市场看看，再见。。。”犹豫片刻，最后还是把那称呼说了出来，“师傅？”"}
{"time": 1776261641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1767527829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“......去吧，以后惹了事，不要告诉别人我是你师父”胖先生沉默，然后背过身去说"}
{"time": 1776261651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1968201936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "声音略微颤抖"}
{"time": 1776261659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1799784217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“好，谢师傅教导”鞠躬，抱着孩子离开"}
{"time": 1776261686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "818586819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（感觉SV？）"}
