{"time": 1776683886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2128688777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“也许方便掩人耳目吧，大家都在看戏。我也不知道”摇摇头"}
{"time": 1776683891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "420346432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“开店呢，老人家，别睡过头误了生意”付钱，“那就要一把桃木剑吧”"}
{"time": 1776683930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506406976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“现在看来还早，杨兄怎么觉得？进去先把茶楼都看一遍？还是买杯茶偷个闲”"}
{"time": 1776683981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "50127752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“对了，老人家，再打听个事，那边墙上的标语是怎么一回事？”"}
