{"time": 1776684408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1625049096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这个护身符是用红沁玉制成的，可保人平安”他掏出一个华贵的盒子，打开后是一块沁着红色的玉护身符"}
{"time": 1776684455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685299426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“有驱邪的作用吗？多少钱？”"}
{"time": 1776684508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1746723661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1630262491]电话接通了，江警官的声音传来”现在开始行动吗？“"}
{"time": 1776684559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "318854914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=685299426]”有的有的，只要800块钱，看在小友支持我的生意的份上，750可以卖给你们“"}
{"time": 1776684615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1540195993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1746723661]“差不多了，我和王逍遥现在在茶楼，另外两人也快到了，待会儿得麻烦你带带孩子”"}
{"time": 1776684675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1218497593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“那我现在过来”"}
{"time": 1776684676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1236862614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=318854914]“多少？”有些诧异，揉了揉眼睛，再好好看看这镇店之宝，“这东西有什么特别的功效吗？值得卖这么贵？怕不是场骗局？”"}
