{"time": 1776688333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1499136922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”说真的，要不是还得赴约，我早两脚踢开凳子溜了“"}
