{"time": 1776688548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946657462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "#凑过去插话"}
{"time": 1776688617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1375259176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“是吧，茶楼的戏班子平时都是演一些早就流传的经典剧目，只有每年的这两天才会演他们原创的傩戏”"}
{"time": 1776688640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1998462807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“好像叫仙姑戏和太子戏来着”"}
{"time": 1776688667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167306670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“你们看过几次了呀，每次都这么胆战心惊的吗”"}
{"time": 1776688712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2104950829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“心惊胆战？什么意思？哦，你是说那吞剑吗？看着虽然很吓人，但是大家都知道是假的嘛”"}
{"time": 1776688740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "860243460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“第一次看嘛”笑笑，“跟真的一样啊”"}
