{"time": 1776688920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "552265522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“和那个无关吧，民间怪谈罢了，茶楼的太子戏讲的是哪吒三太子的故事啊”"}
{"time": 1776689031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "612701116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“哦，原来何仙姑和荷仙姑，三太子和三太子都是不一样的……”"}
