{"time": 1777290934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063501037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“或许他只是一时发善心，但我得提醒你们，那孩子可不是什么可怜虫，他是一个活不了多久的厉鬼，跟他扯上关系的人从来没有好下场。”"}
{"time": 1777290947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "668597664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2063501037]（她"}
