{"time": 1777463609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "473751548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "一夜无梦，你们在房间中醒来，或许是因为关帝庙中午要举行中元节的活动，街上的气氛有些热闹起来"}
{"time": 1777463667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "983241263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "#去典当铺"}
{"time": 1777463669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1249689803", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "起身靠窗，看看街上能有多热闹"}
{"time": 1777463674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341179494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "#起身靠窗，看看街上能有多热闹"}
{"time": 1777463774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1085172516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "街上多了许多带着一两岁小孩的家长，也有很多小贩在卖吆喝，望向湖边，去游船的人也多了不少"}
{"time": 1777463788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1025540892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "打个哈欠，洗漱完和大家说一句，“我再去茶楼看看”，说完就出门过去"}
{"time": 1777463882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "818919587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=983241263]你来到了这个看起来有些历史的当铺，前台坐着镶着金牙的老爷子和一个看起来像他儿子的年轻人"}
{"time": 1777463910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "468987206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "带着晓梅一起洗漱，出门在街边逛逛，看看小贩们都在卖些什么？"}
{"time": 1777463976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1455829543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=818919587]“老板，你什么东西都收吗？”"}
{"time": 1777464025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1128778201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=468987206]有的小贩在卖些小孩玩的玩具，有些在卖糖葫芦、烧饼、油糍等小吃"}
{"time": 1777464057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "834415798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（热糍粑，香甜糯）"}
{"time": 1777464091, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253287367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“得看你要当的东西值不值得我出钱了”老爷子笑眯眯地说道"}
{"time": 1777464148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "837336337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1128778201]找小贩买个拨浪鼓塞晓梅手里，自己再买个糍粑，顺便问小贩:“你们这摊都摆到几点啊？”"}
{"time": 1777464179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1975051346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（月亮粑粑，肚里坐个嗲嗲）"}
{"time": 1777464203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642831231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（嗲嗲出来买菜，绣个糍粑）"}
{"time": 1777464214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "316287522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“摆到中午休息一会儿，等他们逛完庙再出来卖哩”"}
{"time": 1777464297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461424066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“庙会有啥好玩的没，你有了解没？”"}
{"time": 1777464344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2120310984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“一点小道消息，不知先生可否有兴趣”"}
{"time": 1777464375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "174477280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（来典当铺卖情报的来了"}
{"time": 1777464391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "47817917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "”至于价格……也用信息来换，您意下如何？”"}
{"time": 1777464436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "408465200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（不是不行对吧（）"}
{"time": 1777464453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1271159126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（有标了地名的地图吗？）"}
{"time": 1777464457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "91206060", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（我已经迷路了）"}
{"time": 1777464470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244695588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我记得，上午没啥活动，中午可以去那儿吃斋饭，下午有祈福的活动，晚上可以去放河灯”"}
{"time": 1777464490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1219926738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=374796DA2091665E9B7DD036DE3015AE.jpeg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRI9mO5xuU7afMrZ7cx6SmBEKgGsxjwkCQg_wooksDmm4OTlAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQfczGzBLFGH_xmLLmoyfXA3oCIxKCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMM84W67rDdogYfsZ6pGd-CxlzxugImDVAF5eqC9iP1_b86ja0LC2IRaOdjVOOkZBRg,file_size=591984]"}
{"time": 1777464519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "725600966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“放河灯？是在河边放莲花灯祈福的那种活动吗？”"}
{"time": 1777464559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2050690709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=47817917]“你莫不是在逗老爷子我，这里可是典当铺”老爷子手指着店内转了一圈"}
{"time": 1777464585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2092342424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（你可以来找我要八卦炉拿去卖了（）"}
{"time": 1777464607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2053094415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1025540892]你又来到了茶楼，即使是早上，也有不少人在这里喝茶闲聊，可见生意之热闹"}
{"time": 1777464646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "673899527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（地图在哪来着）"}
{"time": 1777464660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253700404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "“那算我俗眼看人低了，给您赔个不是。就是有几个问题想请老板请教请教。”"}
{"time": 1777464670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357722287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "（你不收那我就直接问了）"}
{"time": 1777464684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1623142209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "*走进茶楼，招呼店小二来杯茶休息一下，听听大家在聊什么"}
{"time": 1777464688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1979522146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（我记得发过地图"}
{"time": 1777464727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "439910326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（是，不过我电脑消息没同步，看不到了）"}
{"time": 1777464755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089407927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "都是些家常琐事，还有关于今天庙会的讨论"}
{"time": 1777464845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "71528832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "带着一口广普，在点单的时候问问店小二，“今天是有庙会吗？看大家聊得很热闹啊，你们庙会有什么活动吗？”"}
{"time": 1777464884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "215003286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=725600966]“差不多，好像关帝庙还会做一个最大的河灯，可以划船去抢，谁抢到谁就会获得好运”"}
{"time": 1777464927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "954505196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=253700404]“你说吧”"}
