{"time": 1777470863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1375548760", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“啊？我来吗，我没什么经验”"}
{"time": 1777470863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "536464992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "把晓梅递给王逍遥，整理一下身上的破旧道袍"}
{"time": 1777470880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1207081689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“没事，抱着就行，别抢她毛绒玩具”"}
{"time": 1777470913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821801160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“好吧，你找道长干啥。我就在这附近逛逛等你？”"}
{"time": 1777471004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "866064970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1821801160]“我觉得那道长可能知道些什么，一会我回左偏殿找你”"}
{"time": 1777471020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "577900064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "与王逍遥告别，前往右偏殿"}
{"time": 1777471038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098603104", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（okok）"}
{"time": 1777471080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1618196714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“一路注意安全。”勉为其难接过晓梅，一路走去左偏殿"}
{"time": 1777471084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792255447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（路上有没有什么好玩的）"}
{"time": 1777471164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069640312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "右偏殿摆了几张桌子，一个年轻道长正在准备笔墨和黄纸之类的物件"}
{"time": 1777471171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1391082719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1792255447]（没有，就逛）"}
{"time": 1777471206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1290311694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "（那就慢慢逛过去吧）"}
{"time": 1777471227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "750340949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2069640312]上前去打个招呼:“请问是云清道长吗？”"}
{"time": 1777471258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1420156342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1618196714]左偏殿里面有很多道长在准备吃食"}
{"time": 1777471271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1369014055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=750340949]“是的，你是？”"}
{"time": 1777471420, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1954819387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1369014055]“只是个小道士，道号清舟，有朋友托我来办点事。啊，道长正忙呢，需要我帮忙吗？”#上前去试图搭把手"}
{"time": 1777471466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1071786352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯，暂时还不需要帮忙”"}
{"time": 1777471523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "775573260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“关于求子的，我一般替人做学业和官运，对这一块不是很了解，打听到道长对求子有些道法？”"}
{"time": 1777471559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1727920927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“嗯？你从哪里听说的”他停下手中动作"}
{"time": 1777471575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "453367695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“那对夫妻的生辰八字需要我转达吗？”#从北京妙峰山数年的时光中找一对夫妻的生辰八字，准备写下来"}
{"time": 1777471645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "860735585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“我一路云游，到处打听，遇到一对夫妻，他们让我来这一块找个道号云清的高人道士”"}
{"time": 1777471730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1215620793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“那对夫妻说他们本来都已经对孩子不抱希望了，结果遇到我时，夫人已经怀了三个月了”"}
{"time": 1777471815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2014860592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这个……你得让他们亲自前来”"}
{"time": 1777472008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1736857362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“其实丈夫身体有些不便，去年生了场大病，恐怕活不长久了，但你知道的，多少得传承一下香火嘛，就托我替他们找点道法，他们也有恩于我。”\n顿了顿，“如果道长担心道法外传，那我清舟道人，在此立誓，不会外传道法，只完成恩人最后传承香火的愿望”"}
{"time": 1777472189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1559253842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“这不太好办啊，她得亲自来才可以”"}
{"time": 1777472294, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1473523038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“真没办法吗？我是从北京一路过来的，现在让她们过来，恐怕赶不太及啊”"}
{"time": 1777472313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1277821284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "“道长如果有什么要求我都可以努力帮你实现的”"}
{"time": 1777472388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1985201504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“………这好像不太合规矩……”"}
{"time": 1777472424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "853452376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（我得消失一会）"}
{"time": 1777472428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "565315643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2483922115"}, "sender": {"id": "2483922115", "name": "湘江August"}, "message": "（到站了）"}
{"time": 1777472462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1765164612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "（到湖南了？）"}
{"time": 1777472479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "284512761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（话说"}
